2025.acl-long.332,,,,2025.acl-long.332,done,University of Waterloo | Votee AI | Vector Institute,"# Theorem Explain Agent: Towards Video-based Multimodal Explanations for LLM Theorem Understanding

$\spadesuit^{\dagger}$ Max Ku* Thomas Chong* Jonathan Leung Krish Shah

$\text{心}$ Alvin Yu $\spadesuit$ Wenhu Chen

m3ku@uwaterloo.ca, thomas.chong@votea.ai, wenhu.chen@uwaterloo.ca

$\spadesuit$ University of Waterloo $\text{♥}$ Votee AI $\dagger$ Vector Institute

https://tiger-ai-lab.github.io/TheoremExplainAgent/

Prompt: Show your understanding on Bubble Sort.

(Text Element) Bubble Sort is a straightforward sorting algorithm that works on the principle of repeatedly comparing and swapping adjacent elements until the list is sorted. The process involves iterating through the list multiple times ...

(Multimodal Elements)

Bubble Sort is :

![](images/50254c2392e72c95afaafc0c65c787637f11975b81afe676914ecc83a8840001.jpg)

Explainability

![](images/abb6edab5ae3adc28e2fa73738b12efa004f511c9fe17fdcddffdf83c31eda3d.jpg)

Compare $1^{\mathrm{st}}$ and $2^{\mathrm{nd}}$

![](images/0c98da0e5b70cc264cc7a6caf6773e1cdfc6bd967e064696bd15d8fe4d66c709.jpg)

![](images/dab8c661bac29593325893f98092b18c715de15853a884f0281c41a2b8609d41.jpg)

Compare $2^{\text{nd}}$ and $3^{\text{rd}}$

Interpretability

![](images/11069463d74a8dd286010e1d1a25e75bae7e74dcd163191eee8d99c7fd672368.jpg)

Percent of total

![](images/a3709754c5a08366028afff7b3b79d454eb81dfa0a9d7ae3587bdf3a6bd54cd1.jpg)

![](images/bacc4671cb11f7720dc51bbc834e169c7f24542d2ca19c3acabc43f38a4d6fcb.jpg)  
Figure 1: We do not have knowledge of a thing until we have grasped its cause (Aristotle, 1901). A strong reasoning model should not only generate correct conclusions but also communicate them effectively. Visualization enhances human intuition by making abstract concepts more concrete and revealing hidden relationships. Moreover, visual explanations expose reasoning errors more clearly than text, making it easier to diagnose model mistakes.

Repeat until sorted

Harder to Grasp at a Glance

